Error handling is minimal for brevity but can be expanded upon. Performance optimization, resource management, and scalability are not addressed directly but can be improved through appropriate data structures, buffer management, and threading mechanisms. The provided API is simple and flexible, allowing easy switching between encryption modes and key sizes.

