Ensure robust error handling by catching and logging exceptions during database operations, and by adding checks to handle duplicate values, missing input lists, and network interruptions gracefully. Finally, consider implementing mechanisms for monitoring, failover, and load balancing across multiple instances when running in a distributed environment.

